#: app/main/routes.py:177
msgid ""
"I booked a room in Abidjan while I was still in London, and seeing the "
"price instantly in my own currency made the whole process feel "
"effortless. No guesswork, no surprises at checkout — just a clear, honest"
" price from start to finish. Jambo made booking across borders feel as "
"simple as booking a hotel at home."
msgstr ""

#: app/main/routes.py:180
msgid "Frequent Traveler"
msgstr ""

#: app/main/routes.py:183
msgid ""
"Listing my first room on Jambo took less than ten minutes, and within a "
"week I had my first booking. Being able to set my own discount and track "
"my earnings right from my dashboard gives me real control over my own "
"listing. It's turned a spare room into a genuine, reliable source of "
"income."
msgstr ""

#: app/main/routes.py:186
msgid "Host, Cocody"
msgstr ""

#: app/main/routes.py:189
msgid ""
"My family is originally from Dakar, and I go back every year to visit. "
"Being able to browse listings and book everything in French, with prices "
"shown in euros before I even convert anything in my head, makes the whole"
" process so much less stressful. Jambo genuinely feels like it was built "
"with people like me in mind."
msgstr ""

#: app/main/routes.py:192
msgid "Guest, Paris"
msgstr ""

#: app/main/routes.py:195
msgid ""
"I was nervous about hosting for the first time, but the review system "
"gave me confidence — guests could see I was trustworthy before they even "
"messaged me, and I could see the same about them. Payments land in my "
"account already converted, no confusion about exchange rates. Its been a "
"genuinely reliable way to earn extra income from a room I was not using."
msgstr ""

