#: app/templates/pages/aboutus.html:54
msgid ""
"Jambo was founded in 2025 when the concept of regrouping\n"
"            individuals with available space and willing to share their "
"homes\n"
"            was introduced. Next, we thought that broadening our services"
" to encompass guest\n"
"            houses and small to medium-sized hotels will be ideal."
