#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:82
msgid "Scope"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:84
msgid ""
"This policy explains how payments are processed on Jambo, how host "
"payouts work, and the terms under which a guest or host may cancel a "
"confirmed booking. It applies to every booking made through the Jambo "
"platform."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:87
msgid "How Payment Works"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:89
msgid ""
"When a guest books a room, payment is collected in full by Jambo through "
"our payment processor, Paystack. Jambo does not directly handle or store "
"card details -- this is managed entirely by Paystack, a licensed payment "
"service provider."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:92
msgid ""
"All bookings are processed and settled in West African CFA Francs (XOF), "
"regardless of the currency a guest may have been viewing prices in while "
"browsing the site."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:95
msgid "Platform Commission"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:97
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Jambo retains a 15%% commission on the total booking value. This fee "
"covers platform operation, payment processing, customer support, and the "
"trust and safety measures built into the booking process."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:100
msgid "Host Payouts"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:102
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The remaining 85%% of the booking value is transferred to the host's "
"agreed payment method within 5 working days of Jambo receiving the "
"guest's payment."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:105
msgid ""
"Hosts are responsible for providing accurate, up-to-date payout details. "
"Jambo is not responsible for delays caused by incorrect or outdated "
"payment information provided by the host."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:108
msgid "Guest Cancellations & Refunds"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:110
msgid "Free Cancellation Window"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:112
msgid ""
"A guest may cancel a confirmed booking and receive a full refund, free of"
" charge, provided the cancellation is made at least 48 hours before the "
"scheduled arrival date."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:115
msgid "Cancellations After the Free Window"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:117
msgid ""
"If a guest wishes to cancel less than 48 hours before arrival, the "
"booking is no longer eligible for automatic, free cancellation. To "
"request a refund at this stage, the guest must:"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:120
msgid ""
"Email ropero.app@gmail.com with the booking reference and reason for the "
"request."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:121
#, python-format
msgid ""
"A 20%% service charge will be deducted from the refund amount, to cover "
"processing and administrative costs already incurred."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:122
msgid ""
"The remaining balance will be refunded to the guest's original payment "
"method."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:125
msgid "Refund Currency"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:127
msgid ""
"Refunds are issued in the same currency the original payment was "
"processed in (XOF), regardless of the guest's browsing currency "
"preference."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:130
msgid "Refund Processing Time"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:132
msgid "Approved refunds are processed within 10 working days."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:135
msgid "Host Cancellations"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:137
#, python-format
msgid ""
"If a host cancels a confirmed booking before the guest's arrival without "
"reasonable cause, the host will be charged a fee equal to 15%% of the "
"total booking amount, deducted from their earnings."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:140
msgid ""
"The guest will receive a full refund for a booking cancelled by the host "
"under this section."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:143
msgid "Disputes"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:145
msgid ""
"Any disputes regarding a charge, refund, or payout should be directed to "
"ropero.app@gmail.com in the first instance."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:148
msgid "Changes to This Policy"
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/pages/payment_policy.html:150
msgid ""
"Jambo may update this policy from time to time. Continued use of the "
"platform after changes are published constitutes acceptance of the "
"revised terms."
msgstr ""

